write("Q-403","full_visual_process","R4-S07.console","Write at least 150 words explaining the island-trial process: calibration and duties, output preparation, actual execution, two observations and current acceptance. Use the recorded run and configuration. State the load, reserve, contact and finite-time limits. Separate machine control from experiment observations.","以至少150词说明孤网流程：校准/岗位、输出准备、实际执行、两观察及当前接受，使用真实运行配置，说明负荷、储备、联络和有限时间，分机械制止与实验观察。",dict(title_en="A bounded process, not a safety guarantee",columns_en=["Stage","Order","Declared minute"],rows=[["Calibrate and prepare",1,0],["Control machine and connect TEST",2,0],["Start actual run",3,0],["Intermediate observation",4,5],["Final observation and acceptance",5,10]],availability="after_actual_saved_run"))
write("Q-404","full_argument","R4-S08.reporter","Write at least 250 words comparing the technical options. Use positive and failed evidence, the present Prism safety work, transition-week concerns and the public preparation list. Give a bounded recommendation while preserving independent review. Locate the holding facility from the permitted records without claiming Mara's current life status. This report does not choose the final policy.","以至少250词比较技术方案，使用正反证据、棱镜当前安全、过渡周担忧与公开清单，提出有限建议并保留独立复核，以获准记录定位扣押设施，不声称玛拉目前生死；此报告不决定终局政策。")
